  "summary_en": "Japan's Digital Agency guideline governing use of the name and official logo of \"Government AI Genai\", its government generative-AI environment partly released as OSS. It separates copyright licensing from trademark elements and sets display rules by user category, modification level and provision mode, with mandatory disclaimers.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Copyright licence (OSS) is separated from permission to use brand elements (name, logo).",
   "Descriptive factual references to Genai need no prior permission.",
   "Derivatives must have their own names and carry a standard non-endorsement notice.",
   "Users are split into five categories (ministries, municipalities, corporations, individuals/groups, third parties) with permitted display modes by table.",
   "Digital Agency sets up a contact point and may request correction or take legal action for misleading use."
  ],
